Package: librnnoise0
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: recurrent neural network audio noise suppression library
 RNNoise combines signal processing and recurrent neural networks to suppress
 background noise in speech audio.

Package: librnnoise-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: librnnoise0 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: development files for the RNNoise audio library
 This package provides the header, shared-library link, and pkg-config metadata
 required to build applications using RNNoise.

